# GitHub Linguist counts bytes, so the generated report files (which embed
# figures and rendered equations as base64) would otherwise dominate the
# language statistics and label this a "HTML" project. Mark generated
# documentation and data so the reported language reflects the source code.

report/*.html   linguist-documentation
report/*.md     linguist-documentation
report/*.docx   linguist-documentation
report/*.pdf    linguist-documentation
results/**      linguist-generated
data/*.csv      linguist-generated
*.ipynb         linguist-documentation
